	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><!-- A Typical Day at ISSI -->
<div style="padding: 2rem 1rem;">
<h2 style="text-align: left; color: #004b87; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Typical Day &amp; Schedule</h2>
<p>Student Institute Schedules for Beginner - Intermediate and High Intermediate - High Superior Levels</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please email us at <a href="mailto:issi@ltcc.edu">issi@ltcc.edu</a>.</p>
<hr /><!-- Beginner - Intermediate Schedule -->
<h3 style="color: #004b87; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Daily View: ISSI Low-Tier Courses (SPA 121A-122CA)</h3>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: left;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">Time</th>
<th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">Course</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">8:00 AM - 8:50 AM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">Conversation (Intermediate II and II) or Warm-Up (all other low-tier levels)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">9:00 AM - 9:50 AM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">Grammar Instruction</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">10:00 AM - 10:50 AM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">Grammar Instruction</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">10:50 AM - 12:30 PM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;"><strong>LUNCH BREAK</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">12:30 PM - 1:20 PM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">
<p>Monday: Grammar Instruction</p>
<p>Tuesday through Friday: Breakouts (different ones every day!)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">1:30 PM - 2:20 PM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">
<p>Monday: Grammar Instruction</p>
<p>Tuesday through Friday: Breakouts (different ones every day!)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">2:30 PM - 3:20 PM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">Monday through Thursday: Series (the same theme spread over 4 days!)<br />Friday: Fiesta</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">3:40 PM - 4:55 PM</td>
<td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px;">Monday through Thursday: Optional Mini-Courses <br />Friday: Fiesta (Faculty have other responsibilities)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
